<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Fizzy • IRL Sylveon</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Fizzy – fursuiter, programmer, musician, degen">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">fizzysylv<span>.xyz</span></a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#projects">Stuff I Make</a>
        <a href="#skills">Things I Mess With</a>
        <a href="blog.fizzysylv.xyz">Blog</a>
        <a href="#contact">Socials</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <p class="eyebrow">welcome, silly billy</p>

          <h1>Hi, I’m <span class="accent">Fizzy</span>!</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">
            I’m a fursuiter, programmer, musician, and occasional AV goblin.
            I build weird tools, write code for fun, and run around in suit

            being a menace (affectionate).
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#contact">Find me online</a>
            <a class="btn outline" href="/blog/">Open blog.log</a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-note">

            Currently juggling fursuiting, code, con work, and too many ideas at once.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-photo">
          <div class="photo-frame">
            <!-- swap this with a fursuit or avatar pic if you want -->
            <img src="assets/img/profile.jpg" alt="Fizzy">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About -->
    <section id="about" class="section">
      <div class="container two-column">
        <div>
          <h2>About Fizzy</h2>
          <p>
            I exist somewhere between <strong>fursuiting</strong>,
            <strong>programming</strong>, and <strong>music</strong>. Some days
            I’m hacking on Discord bots and systems stuff, other days I’m
            bouncing around at a con in suit, and sometimes I remember that my
            bass guitar misses me.

          </p>
          <p>
            I like building things that feel a little bit cursed but still
            genuinely useful: automation for communities, strange little tools,
            scheduling helpers, and whatever else my brain fixates on this week.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <h3>Current obsessions</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Fursuiting at cons and local events.</li>
            <li>Programming Discord bots and backend tools.</li>
            <li>Messing with Rust, C++, and other low-level shenanigans.</li>
            <li>Playing and writing music when my brain lets me focus.</li>
            <li>Documenting chaos on <a href="/blog/">the blog</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects / Stuff I Make -->
    <section id="projects" class="section alt">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Stuff I Make</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          A non-exhaustive list of projects, experiments, and ongoing chaos.
        </p>


        <div class="card-grid">
          <!-- Project 1 -->
          <article class="card">

            <h3>Discord Bots & Tools</h3>
            <p>

              Bots for servers I hang out in: custom currency, mimic accounts,
              scheduling helpers, and random quality-of-life features that probably
              shouldn’t work as well as they do.
            </p>
            <ul class="tag-list">
              <li>Rust / C++</li>
              <li>Discord API</li>
              <li>Automation</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="card-links">
              <a href="https://github.com/your-github-here" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                view repos

              </a>
            </p>
          </article>


          <!-- Project 2 -->
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Scheduling & Management Apps</h3>
            <p>
              Web apps for organizing humans: mechanic shop management systems,
              pool scheduling, and other “I was tired of doing this by hand”
              projects.

            </p>
            <ul class="tag-list">
              <li>Web stuff</li>
              <li>Databases</li>
              <li>Too many spreadsheets</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="card-links">

              <a href="/blog/" >
                read dev logs
              </a>
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Project 3 -->
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Music & Audio Experiments</h3>
            <p>
              Writing songs, playing bass, experimenting with plugins, and
              occasionally screaming at DAWs until they work the way I want.
            </p>
            <ul class="tag-list">
              <li>Bass guitar</li>
              <li>Songwriting</li>
              <li>Noise but in a good way</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="card-links">
              <a href="#">(coming soon) music home</a>
            </p>
          </article>


          <!-- Project 4 -->
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Con AV & Tech Shenanigans</h3>
            <p>
              Helping run video and tech at conventions: cameras, switchers,
              routing, and the thrill of keeping everything alive while a show
              is happening.
            </p>
            <ul class="tag-list">
              <li>PTZ cams</li>
              <li>Blackmagic gear</li>
              <li>Controlled chaos</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="card-links">
              <a href="/blog/">
                con stories
              </a>
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- Skills / Things I Mess With -->
    <section id="skills" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Things I Mess With</h2>
        <div class="skills-grid">
          <div>
            <h3>Tech & Code</h3>
            <ul>

              <li>Rust, C, C++</li>
              <li>Python, Go (a bit)</li>
              <li>SQL, databases, data wrangling</li>
              <li>Discord bots & APIs</li>
              <li>Linux, servers, general yak-shaving</li>
            </ul>

          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Creative Stuff</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Fursuiting & character performance</li>
              <li>Music, bass guitar, songwriting</li>
              <li>Video production & streaming</li>
              <li>Overlay / UI tinkering</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3>Other Brainworms</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Cryptography & security tidbits</li>
              <li>Silly little automation scripts</li>
              <li>Making spreadsheets do crimes</li>
              <li>Turning problems into projects</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Socials / Contact -->

    <section id="contact" class="section alt">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Socials</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Best way to reach me is through socials. I lurk online a lot.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div>
            <p>
              Need to get in touch, ask about a project, or just yell about

              something cool you built? Ping me on Twitter or wherever below
              and I’ll probably see it.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-links">
            <p>
              <strong>Twitter:</strong>
              <a href="https://twitter.com/Sinnaminty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                @Sinnaminty
              </a>
            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>GitHub:</strong>
              <a href="https://github.com/Sinnaminty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                github.com/Sinnaminty
              </a>

            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>Twitch:</strong>
              <a href="https://www.twitch.tv/sinnaminty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                twitch.tv/sinnaminty
              </a>
            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>Discord:</strong>
                @Sinnaminty
            </p>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <p>© <span id="year"></span> Fizzy • fizzysylv.xyz</p>
      <p><a href="blog.fizzysylv.xyz">open blog</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>

